      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见集团的精英赛马娘\n里见皇冠。她的目标是\n为里见家带来至高荣誉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d23a6d04aebb62643f7996ca8c48f7353d91eb89043733528853a32a76a2eda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
