      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见皇冠等人不断反复尝试摸索，\n终于从过去的比赛中找到突破困境的方法──",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb10bcaf3e44a175f42eee2ac5997a36f477a7b13d374de3fdc7afc18b06d940",
