    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43271165c80a7932923cf20b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "「日本德比」结束后，\n世人无不谈论着大鸣大放与里见皇冠。\n然而──",
      "source_fingerprint": "03423b108be54ce1f20cf2e4a94fd5576e000ab43c60548503c3bce342fd78be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af68ead82a76773b80f23b8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大鸣大放骨折了，\n必须暂时专心治疗……也因此\n无法参赛「菊花赏」与「凯旋门赏」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60018d641d31709e83490e2e88e3f14c73fb6a2b32f1923454bdb8baa8f2f8d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c65f5590b5589ccc9a8b7e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但里见皇冠仍相信\n大鸣大放能够回归赛场，\n相信一定还有打倒对方的机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56140576a71cc1f4ee2bd42323813742d224eca9f8a7d6ebbdeeffe98742ad12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f79d7518a08d6ae2522c94b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹意志消沉。\n少了大鸣大放我就有机会赢得「菊花赏」了，\n萌生此想法让她为自己感到羞愧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "067d82ed19dd4b6ffbec8c87201c2a2f219a78734d58156f46d6dc5350b5c1ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c580eeebed383824acd34e77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在舞台侧边",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e6cd5f2c945cd736ab477ef154f8007d21bf6ebe4c90a5d818f8cfde964d2d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088403.json",
