    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44d075b1ce0babd34a6408cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹持续锻炼着跑步实力。\n若她依此步调继续进步下去，\n想必终将成为最强的领头赛马娘。因此──",
      "source_fingerprint": "642fc32e832894293d448480bed9dc4a7583a4c22bc0947290bf512b87939e4a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088404.json",
      "json_path": [
