    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fced69d3f530c6b1cd1e510",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了找出对策，\n里见皇冠前往香港进行模拟赛。\n对手是以「领头」称霸了全世界的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1ead21be33da690cb368add233bd440cce2c48368a5d4df28750d2b100eb2af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088404.json",
      "json_path": [
