    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c18d2c4918c789f241d766b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天是里见光钻挑战「日本德比」的日子。\n比赛结果──蹄铁脱落导致她仅得到第二名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5269cf496f6eb3abd8cc16d725eb9d33c72cbd3997d822dad7da7e0e66e77e1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
