    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3124140b1430355a19d35ade",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管里见光钻不幸地错失胜利，\n但她不露出一丝消沉，\n并威风凛凛地声明将在「菊花赏」获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "def4343362149834f4d1faf02f130735615eb8be30a3ad4b1e76a91a5a7387ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
