    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a74c691fcc3db7fbcf6aeea1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与此同时，\n北部玄驹也进行着险峻严苛的训练。\n她的成长幅度让里见皇冠瞠目结舌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0b1235f49690e1a69972bf36cd90832f4eb858c25f8a858a4a998525bd4bb89",
